  subtitle: "Product Designer, AI Builder",
  body: "I help design teams solve their hardest use cases by combining curiosity, craft, cutting-edge tools, and a focus on how real people think and work. Whether it’s file sharing, government budgets, construction projects, or cybersecurity, companies lean on me to bring clarity and creativity to the hard problems of complex industries.",
